OL,3,GNEWSASon who took his life 'failed'
OL,4,Aafter leaving court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man who took his own
OL,7,Flife hours after being convicted of
OL,8,Fdrink driving said "more should have
OL,9,Fbeen done" to keep him safe after he
OL,10,Fleft court.
OL,12,FNoel Porter from Woodbridge was found
OL,13,Fdead in a car park in Ipswich on 22
OL,14,FNovember 2023 ` a day after admitting
OL,15,Fdrink driving at Ipswich Magistrates'
OL,16,FCourt.
OL,18,FAfter being handed a fine and banned
OL,19,Ffrom driving, the 25-year-old welder
OL,20,Fwas released from custody before taking
OL,21,Fhis own life hours later.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
